        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \Omega =H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/07486e4486f121ba8268c5c82842a4d61699ca43" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.84ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Omega =H}"/></span> (a <b id="mwIA">regular wreath product</b>), though a different <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt32" id="mwIQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Omega"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle \Omega }">
