<p id="mwLA">The notion generalizes to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semigroup" title="Semigroup" id="mwLQ">semigroups</a> and, as such, is a central construction in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krohn-Rhodes_theory" title="Krohn-Rhodes theory" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLg">Krohn–Rhodes structure theory</a> of finite semigroups.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwLw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwMA" aria-labelledby="Definition"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Definition">Definition</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Wreath_product&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Definition"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

