</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/5deca3fc0a077949dd37a300921f9e516587af44" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:8.589ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {wr} _{\Omega }H}"/></span>.</li>
<li id="mwbA">In literature, the <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mwbQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
