</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/7daff47fa58cdfd29dc333def748ff5fa4c923e3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.743ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle A}"/></span>.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwfw" aria-labelledby="Properties"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Properties">Properties</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Wreath_product&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Properties"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwgA" aria-labelledby="Agreement_of_unrestricted_and_restricted_wreath_product_on_finite_Ω"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Agreement_of_unrestricted_and_restricted_wreath_product_on_finite_Ω"><span id="Agreement_of_unrestricted_and_restricted_wreath_product_on_finite_.CE.A9" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>Agreement of unrestricted and restricted wreath product on finite Ω</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Wreath_product&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Agreement of unrestricted and restricted wreath product on finite Ω"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwgQ">Since the finite direct product is the same as the finite direct sum of groups, it follows that the unrestricted wreath product <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt89" id="mwgg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"A\\operatorname{Wr}_\\Omega H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {Wr} _{\Omega }H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>A</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>Wr</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>⁡<!-- ⁡ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle A\operatorname {Wr} _{\Omega }H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f65c48c049679e678c9bf9aab0281fd4e9a60665" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:9.3ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {Wr} _{\Omega }H}"/></span> and the restricted wreath product <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt90" id="mwgw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"A\\operatorname{wr}_\\Omega H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {wr} _{\Omega }H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>A</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>wr</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>⁡<!-- ⁡ --></mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle A\operatorname {wr} _{\Omega }H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/5deca3fc0a077949dd37a300921f9e516587af44" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:8.589ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {wr} _{\Omega }H}"/></span> are equal if <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt91" id="mwhA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Omega"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle \Omega }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \Omega }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/24b0d5ca6f381068d756f6337c08e0af9d1eeb6f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.678ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Omega }"/></span> is finite. In particular, this is true when <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt92" id="mwhQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Omega = H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle \Omega =H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \Omega =H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/07486e4486f121ba8268c5c82842a4d61699ca43" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.84ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Omega =H}"/></span> and <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt93" id="mwhg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/75a9edddcca2f782014371f75dca39d7e13a9c1b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.064ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H}"/></span> is finite.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwhw" aria-labelledby="Subgroup"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Subgroup">Subgroup</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Wreath_product&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Subgroup"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwiA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt94" id="mwiQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"A\\operatorname{wr}_\\Omega H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle A\operatorname {wr} _{\Omega }H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>A</mi>
        <msub>
          <mi>wr</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
          </mrow>
