<ul id="mwtA"><li id="mwtQ">The <b id="mwtg">imprimitive</b> wreath product action on <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt118" id="mwtw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Lambda\\times\\Omega"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle \Lambda \times \Omega }">
