<dl id="mwuA"><dd id="mwuQ">If <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt119" id="mwug" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"((a_\\omega), h)\\in A \\operatorname{Wr}_\\Omega H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle ((a_{\omega }),h)\in A\operatorname {Wr} _{\Omega }H}">
