</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwzQ" aria-labelledby="Examples"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Examples">Examples</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Wreath_product&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Examples"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<ul id="mwzg"><li id="mwzw">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamplighter_group" title="Lamplighter group" id="mw0A">lamplighter group</a> is the restricted wreath product <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt130" id="mw0Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"C_2 \\wr \\mathbb{Z}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle C_{2}\wr \mathbb {Z} }">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msub>
          <mi>C</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>≀<!-- ≀ --></mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle C_{2}\wr \mathbb {Z} }</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c99d908b26b444fa5b0e52274a0316f6f8d8484d" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:5.945ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle C_{2}\wr \mathbb {Z} }"/></span>.</li>
<li id="mw0g">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Generalized_symmetric_group" title="Generalized symmetric group" id="mw0w">generalized symmetric group</a> is <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt131" id="mw1A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"C_m \\wr S_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle C_{m}\wr S_{n}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
