          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle C_{m}\wr S_{n}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0af963f4e662450afebad5c099ad406525fad5ee" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:7.659ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle C_{m}\wr S_{n}}"/></span>. The base of this wreath product is the <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt132" id="mw1Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
