<ul id="mw3w"><li id="mw4A">As a special case, we have the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyperoctahedral_group" title="Hyperoctahedral group" id="mw4Q">hyperoctahedral group</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt138" id="mw4g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_2 \\wr S_n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{2}\wr S_{n}}">
