<li id="mw6Q">The smallest non-trivial wreath product is <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt142" id="mw6g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"C_2 \\wr C_2"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle C_{2}\wr C_{2}}">
