<li id="mwAQc">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubik's_Cube_group" title="Rubik's Cube group" id="mwAQg">Rubik's Cube group</a> is a normal subgroup of index 12 in the product of wreath products, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt159" id="mwAQk" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(C_3 \\wr S_8) \\times (C_2 \\wr S_{12})"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle (C_{3}\wr S_{8})\times (C_{2}\wr S_{12})}">
