<li id="mwAQo">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematics_of_Sudoku#The_sudoku_symmetry_group" title="Mathematics of Sudoku" id="mwAQs">Sudoku validity-preserving transformations (VPT) group</a> contains the double wreath product <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt160" id="mwAQw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(S_3\\wr S_3)\\wr S_2"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle (S_{3}\wr S_{3})\wr S_{2}}">
