</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/13f5e1182c801d8d7031539d1e26a13e2f9c12c7" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:12.605ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (S_{3}\wr S_{3})\wr S_{2}}"/></span>, where the factors are the permutation of rows/columns within a 3-row or 3-column <i id="mwAQ0">band</i> or <i id="mwAQ4">stack</i> (<span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt161" id="mwAQ8" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_3"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{3}}">
