</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/70e15f3e200aaa247f69c43110cc5a09ecc91b89" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.479ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{3}}"/></span>) and the transposition, which interchanges the bands and stacks (<span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt163" id="mwARE" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S_2"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle S_{2}}">
  <semantics>
