</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/41668d7ef97b4985b0b2886cfe8aa8e8423476e1" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:8.287ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle |\Omega _{1}|=3}"/></span>, and secondly the set {bands, stacks} (so <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt166" id="mwARQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"|\\Omega_2|=2"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle |\Omega _{2}|=2}">
