</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b4daff832173a55b15cff0b3f8b26a5540f76de0" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:8.287ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle |\Omega _{2}|=2}"/></span>). Accordingly, <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt167" id="mwARU" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"|S_3\\wr S_3|=|S_3|^3|S_3|=6^4"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle |S_{3}\wr S_{3}|=|S_{3}|^{3}|S_{3}|=6^{4}}">
