            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>≀<!-- ≀ --></mo>
        <mo>⋯<!-- ⋯ --></mo>
        <mo>≀<!-- ≀ --></mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S_{2}\wr S_{2}\wr \cdots \wr S_{2}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0f07214ef547cbb10e5443e1e67a40ccc69c8d76" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:15.198ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{2}\wr S_{2}\wr \cdots \wr S_{2}}"/></span> is the automorphism group of a complete <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Binary_tree" title="Binary tree" id="mwARs">binary tree</a>.</li></ul>

